<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-131-A habitat research</name></metadata><wpt lat="35.503837" lon="-121.096407"><name>SC26-131-A</name><desc>Point Estero rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 9.0 m relief across 210 m. Terrain A 77/100; not catch probability. Center 159 ft; nearby 157–189 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. No additional flag from this depth and closure screening. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9ZSTUK1"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-105</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.50696118952865" lon="-121.09727001137905"/><trkpt lat="35.50635470340848" lon="-121.09882783265728"/><trkpt lat="35.505379047023645" lon="-121.09984308019526"/><trkpt lat="35.50519881273262" lon="-121.09984732719178"/><trkpt lat="35.50528372028719" lon="-121.09951457857976"/><trkpt lat="35.505100012486544" lon="-121.09929841008874"/><trkpt lat="35.504829661120816" lon="-121.09930478232923"/><trkpt lat="35.50447613913184" lon="-121.09975410752536"/><trkpt lat="35.50374999226126" lon="-121.09944047669657"/><trkpt lat="35.50338952366017" lon="-121.0994489719408"/><trkpt lat="35.50330287961648" lon="-121.09967150703474"/><trkpt lat="35.502668586387905" lon="-121.09946596197675"/><trkpt lat="35.50221973708183" lon="-121.09958678461575"/><trkpt lat="35.50158197021198" lon="-121.09916083601945"/><trkpt lat="35.50093377690948" lon="-121.09807367988279"/><trkpt lat="35.5006390865377" lon="-121.09653722879872"/><trkpt lat="35.500713546609404" lon="-121.09554328483179"/><trkpt lat="35.500969973